# Walkthrough: RAG Chatbot Implementation

## Summary

Replaced the Ollama-based chatbot in HealthTwin with a **RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)** pipeline, matching the `medical-chatbot` reference project.

## Architecture

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[User Question] --> B[FastAPI /api/chat]
    B --> C[FAISS Vectorstore]
    C --> D["Top-3 Documents"]
    D --> E[Groq LLM<br>llama-3.1-8b-instant]
    E --> F[Answer + Sources]
    F --> G[Frontend Chat UI]
```

