## To Test the Chatbot

> [!IMPORTANT]
> You **must** set your `GROQ_API_KEY` in the [.env](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Documents/WebD/HackathonProject/healthtwin/.env) file before the chatbot will work.

1. Open [.env](file:///c:/Users/ASUS/Documents/WebD/HackathonProject/healthtwin/.env) and paste your Groq API key
2. Run `venv\Scripts\python -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload`
3. Open `http://localhost:8000` → click **💬 AI Chat**
4. Ask "What is diabetes?" and verify you get a RAG-powered response with source references
